1
00:00:00,523 --> 00:00:04,403
Bhaiya! Drug inspector — bagal wali dukaan mein!

2
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:09,119
H1 register! Mangalvaar se panne khaali!

3
00:00:11,995 --> 00:00:13,688
Das minute hain, Sunita!

4
00:00:14,051 --> 00:00:15,043
Ghabraiye mat.

5
00:00:21,055 --> 00:00:24,022
Namaste. H1 register dikhaiye.

6
00:00:25,083 --> 00:00:26,504
Ji sir, ye raha.

7
00:00:29,357 --> 00:00:33,328
Har H1 bill se bharta hai — mareez, doctor, dawa.

8
00:00:36,094 --> 00:00:38,774
Schedule wali har dawa pe pehle se tag.

9
00:00:39,861 --> 00:00:41,023
Parchiyon ki copy?

10
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:43,638
Is file mein, bill number ke saath.

11
00:00:44,701 --> 00:00:47,563
Record saaf hai. Aise hi rakhiye.

12
00:00:48,789 --> 00:00:51,796
Uff... das minute the ya das saal!

13
00:00:53,786 --> 00:00:58,179
Schedule register, har bill se. Nexcod POS.
